{"seq":1,"slug":"circuits-motifs","title":"电路与模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mechanistic-interpretability/circuits/circuits-motifs","wordCount":1515,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"电路与模式\">电路与模式</h1><p>2021 年《A Mathematical Framework for Transformer Circuits》做了一件影响深远的事：它把 Transformer 那一堆纠缠的矩阵乘法，重写成一个所有组件都能向同一条&quot;总线&quot;读写的视图。这条总线就是残差流，而每个注意力头被拆成两个独立可分析的回路——决定&quot;看哪里&quot;的 QK 回路和决定&quot;搬什么&quot;的 OV 回路。有了这套语言，模型内部的计算第一次能像电路图一样被一条条画出来、读出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>电路</strong>（circuit）是实现某个具体算法的最小组件子图，由若干注意力头和 MLP 神经元通过残差流串联而成。<strong>残差流</strong>（residual stream）是贯穿所有层的共享向量带宽：每一层从中读取信息、计算后再把结果加回去，所以它像一条时间累积的工作内存。<strong>模式</strong>（motif）则指在不同模型、不同位置反复出现的连接结构，比如&quot;上一 token 头 + 归纳头&quot;这一对。</p>\n<p>下图展示残差流如何作为共享总线连接各组件：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  E[token 嵌入] --&gt; RS[残差流&lt;br/&gt;共享读写总线]&#10;  RS --&gt; H1[注意力头&lt;br/&gt;QK 决定看哪里]&#10;  H1 --&gt; OV[OV 决定搬什么]&#10;  OV --&gt; RS&#10;  RS --&gt; MLP[MLP&lt;br/&gt;键值记忆查询]&#10;  MLP --&gt; RS&#10;  RS --&gt; UN[unembedding&lt;br/&gt;读出为下一 token 概率]\">flowchart TD\n  E[token 嵌入] --&gt; RS[残差流&lt;br/&gt;共享读写总线]\n  RS --&gt; H1[注意力头&lt;br/&gt;QK 决定看哪里]\n  H1 --&gt; OV[OV 决定搬什么]\n  OV --&gt; RS\n  RS --&gt; MLP[MLP&lt;br/&gt;键值记忆查询]\n  MLP --&gt; RS\n  RS --&gt; UN[unembedding&lt;br/&gt;读出为下一 token 概率]</pre><p>把电路的几个基本构件并列，便于查阅：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>关键直觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>残差流</td>\n<td>跨层共享的信息总线</td>\n<td>组件加性地读写，信息会累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QK 回路</td>\n<td>计算注意力分数，决定关注哪个位置</td>\n<td>一个 token 的 query 与另一个的 key 内积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OV 回路</td>\n<td>决定关注后搬运什么信息</td>\n<td>与注意力分数无关，独立可分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MLP 层</td>\n<td>逐位置的非线性变换</td>\n<td>近似一座键值记忆库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模式</td>\n<td>反复出现的组件连接结构</td>\n<td>跨模型可复现，是泛化的电路语言</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"残差流-一切的总线\">残差流：一切的总线</h2><p>残差流是读电路的起点。因为每一层的输出都是&quot;加&quot;回残差流而非&quot;替换&quot;，所以残差流在任意位置的向量，等于所有先前组件写入内容的总和。这带来一个分析上的便利：要知道某个特征是从哪来的，只需把残差流按&quot;哪个组件贡献了这个方向&quot;线性分解开——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/features-representations\">特征与表示</a> 里特征即方向的直接应用。</p>\n<p>残差流也是组件之间通信的唯一信道。注意力头之间不直接对话，它们都通过往残差流里写、再从残差流里读来间接协作。这就是为什么&quot;上一 token 头&quot;能给后面的&quot;归纳头&quot;递信息——前者把&quot;上一个 token 是什么&quot;写进残差流，后者再读出来，详见 <a href=\"induction-heads\">归纳头</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"qk-与-ov-注意力头的两半\">QK 与 OV：注意力头的两半</h2><p>一个注意力头做两件可以完全拆开分析的事。<strong>QK 回路</strong>用 query 和 key 的内积算出注意力分数，它只决定&quot;每个位置该关注哪些位置&quot;，是一个关于位置的路由问题。<strong>OV 回路</strong>则决定&quot;一旦关注了某位置，从那里搬运什么信息写回当前位置&quot;，它与注意力分数无关、可以独立研究。</p>\n<p>这个拆分的威力在于：很多电路的功能，看 QK 和 OV 各自的行为就能读懂，而不必纠缠在完整的注意力公式里。比如一个&quot;复制头&quot;的 OV 回路近似恒等映射（搬什么就写什么），它的 QK 回路则负责找到&quot;该复制哪个位置&quot;。注意力头与 MLP 的更细分工，见 <a href=\"attention-mlp-roles\">注意力与MLP的角色</a>。数学上，单头注意力对残差流的贡献可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>out</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>softmax</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>O</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{out} = \\text{softmax}\\!\\left(\\frac{QK^\\top}{\\sqrt{d_k}}\\right) V W_O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">out</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.095em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5864em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8622em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8222em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1778em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.927em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.538em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">QK^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 QK 回路、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>O</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V W_O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 OV 回路。</p>\n<p>读这条公式时，把两个回路分开看就清楚了：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>回路</th>\n<th>公式片段</th>\n<th>决定什么</th>\n<th>能否脱离对方单独研究</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>QK 回路</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{softmax}(QK^\\top/\\sqrt{d_k})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1072em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8572em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8172em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1828em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>关注哪些位置</td>\n<td>能（只关乎位置路由）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OV 回路</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>O</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V W_O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>搬运什么内容</td>\n<td>能（与分数无关）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整头</td>\n<td>两者相乘</td>\n<td>最终的写回</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正因为这两半在公式里就是相乘的独立因子，实践中才能先固定一个、只分析另一个，把复杂的注意力拆成两个各自可解释的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模式-可复现的电路语言\">模式：可复现的电路语言</h2><p>机制可解释性最令人振奋的发现之一，是某些电路结构会跨模型反复出现，被称为模式。归纳模式（上一 token 头 + 归纳头）几乎在所有自回归 Transformer 里都能找到；&quot;名字搬运头&quot;（name mover heads）在间接宾语识别任务里反复出现；&quot;抑制头&quot;则负责压制重复输出。模式的存在说明电路不是每个模型各练各的偶然产物，而是有限几种被反复发现的算法解。</p>\n<p>模式之所以重要，是因为它让经验可迁移：在 GPT-2 small 上读懂一个归纳模式，到更大的模型上往往还能认出同一结构。这也是规模化可解释性的希望所在——若每个模型的电路都全新，逆向工程就永无尽头；正因有模式，才有把 <a href=\"../practice/interpretability-at-scale\">规模化可解释性</a> 推上去的可能。要确认一个候选模式真的在起因果作用，需要用 <a href=\"../methods/activation-patching\">激活补丁与因果干预</a> 去验证，而非仅凭观察。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电路是实现具体算法的组件子图，残差流是连接它们的共享读写总线，信息加性累积、可线性分解。</li>\n<li>每个注意力头可拆成 QK 回路（决定看哪里）和 OV 回路（决定搬什么），两半可独立分析。</li>\n<li>组件之间不直接对话，全靠往残差流读写间接协作。</li>\n<li>模式是跨模型反复出现的电路结构（如归纳模式、名字搬运头），让经验可迁移、规模化成为可能。</li>\n<li>观察到的候选电路必须用因果干预验证，才能确认它真的在起作用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"induction-heads\">归纳头</a>、<a href=\"attention-mlp-roles\">注意力与MLP的角色</a>、<a href=\"../methods/activation-patching\">激活补丁与因果干预</a>、<a href=\"../foundations/features-representations\">特征与表示</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：Transformer 注意力机制的基础见 <a href=\"../../llm-fundamentals/\">LLM 基础</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电路与模式","id":"电路与模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"残差流：一切的总线","id":"残差流-一切的总线"},{"level":2,"text":"QK 与 OV：注意力头的两半","id":"qk-与-ov-注意力头的两半"},{"level":2,"text":"模式：可复现的电路语言","id":"模式-可复现的电路语言"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"叠加假说","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mechanistic-interpretability/foundations/superposition-hypothesis"},"next":{"title":"归纳头","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mechanistic-interpretability/circuits/induction-heads"}}